---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout 
  title="Cost Breakdown Transparency: Understanding Factory Pricing Logic"
  type="FINANCE"
  date="July 03, 2026"
  readTime="11 min read"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif] text-slate-800">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Beyond the Unit Price</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        In activewear manufacturing, the lowest quote is often the most dangerous. For finance and cost-driven procurement teams, the goal is not just a low COGS (Cost of Goods Sold), but a high ROI through quality consistency and supply chain reliability.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">The Anatomy of a FITCLO Quote</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
        We believe in transparency. When you partner with us, we break down your costs into four distinct buckets, allowing your team to identify where optimization is possible.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <ul class="space-y-6 list-none p-0">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-gold mt-2 rounded-full"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Raw Materials (45-55%)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">This includes yarn cost, dyeing, and functional treatments. High-filament Nylon/Spandex blends command a premium but deliver the hand-feel required for high-end retail.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-gold mt-2 rounded-full"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Labor & Craftsmanship (20-30%)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">The cost of expert stitching. Flatlock seams and complex paneling require specialized machinery and skilled technicians, ensuring zero-chafe performance.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-gold mt-2 rounded-full"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Quality Control & Overhead (10-15%)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Our 4-point inspection system and laboratory testing (shrinkage, color fastness, stretch recovery) are built into this component.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-gold mt-2 rounded-full"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Logistics & Duty Optimization (5-10%)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We assist in HTS code classification and strategic consolidation to minimize landing costs.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">ROI Optimization: The Hidden Costs of "Cheap"</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
        A 5% saving on unit price can be wiped out by:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
        <li><strong>Return Rates:</strong> Sub-par stitching leads to seam failure, resulting in customer returns and brand damage.</li>
        <li><strong>Late Deliveries:</strong> Missing the sales window often leads to heavy discounting.</li>
        <li><strong>Fabric Inconsistency:</strong> Variations in shade (shading) between batches can lead to unsold inventory.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-8 rounded-2xl mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Request a Transparent Quote</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">Our costing team can provide a detailed breakdown for your next project within 48 hours.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="#inquiry" class="bg-[#C9A84C] text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#b8973d] transition-colors">Start Cost Analysis</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</GuideLayout>